# Placeholder client CA bundle for mutual TLS.
#
# It exists so that a service with USE_MTLS=yes always has a trust anchor to point
# ssl_client_certificate at, even before the Scheduler has validated and distributed the real
# client CA bundle. No client can chain to it: the private key was generated once, never stored
# and never published, so every client certificate presented against this bundle fails
# verification and the connection is rejected. Never add a usable CA here.
